{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/659fdbb14c0e481cc71e31f7f0a4d2ec.avif?t=1759435990\" width=1280 height=581 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/6124d5663c4ae8b832160ad2cb30c0cf.avif?t=1759435990\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/42a37177afdc5a51d42e1af27c67448a.poster.avif?t=1759435990\" width=885 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/42a37177afdc5a51d42e1af27c67448a.webm?t=1759435990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Community Leader to World Leader</strong><br>Every day throws you an event that could make\u2013or break\u2013your run. Grow your crew, collect shiny buttons, and blast propaganda to secure votes at the polls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Win Hearts or Break Rivals</strong><br>Charm blocs with outreach, or sabotage your opponent until they throw in the towel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/069e3b0ad88ce6ba49346db6c0d4639f.poster.avif?t=1759435990\" width=885 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/069e3b0ad88ce6ba49346db6c0d4639f.webm?t=1759435990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Debates, Reimagined</strong><br>Rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors your way to victory. Politics has never been sillier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Money Talks</strong><br>Budget responsibly... or just pocket it all. Who\u2019s going to stop you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/f665b0c9882fc820594154f0336b54dc.poster.avif?t=1759435990\" width=885 height=395 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/f665b0c9882fc820594154f0336b54dc.webm?t=1759435990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Press Roulette</strong><br>Hate interviews? Spin the wheel and let fate choose your platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend the Calendar</strong><br>Don\u2019t like tomorrow\u2019s agenda? Reschedule it\u2013or cancel it. You\u2019re the boss here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980980/extras/1c4484a97773882345fc5ac1496b2681.webp?t=1759435990\" width=500 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The People Aren\u2019t Easy</strong><br>Each bloc has quirks\u2013l